# Loaded by Vite automatically for `vite build` (mode "production" by
# default). Only variables prefixed with VITE_ are exposed to client code /
# index.html's %VITE_...% interpolation -- see
# https://vite.dev/guide/env-and-mode.html
#
# craftools_api's production deployment, DocumentRoot pointed directly at
# its public/ folder -- so no /public segment here. Matches
# ApiDataLoader.ts, which appends "/v1/?resource=..." to this value itself,
# so this must NOT include /v1 (the app then calls
# https://craftools.cybernow.com.br/v1/?resource=...).
VITE_API_BASE=https://craftools.cybernow.com.br
